From ea46542d6fb2cf7be43dde1550340d660c7eaf54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yasoteien <263659156+yasoteien@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:27:33 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 35/46] pomera_dm250: board code rebuilt from the author binary

sd/emmc commands, RK818 setup, KRNL/RSCE loading, Bluetooth address
from eMMC sys_info, hibernation resume= handling and the legacy eMMC
U-Boot loader/patcher. 11 of 13 functions match the author machine
code instruction for instruction; the other two differ only in
register allocation and block order.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: yasoteien <263659156+yasoteien@users.noreply.github.com>
